Third-party components
----------------------

firmware/
    The Intel HEX firmware files (PknLdr.hex, extracted from the OEM
    F235Ldr.sys, and Pakon7.hex) are third-party device-bootstrapping
    artifacts from the OEM Pakon software, with their own separate terms.
    They are NOT covered by the AGPL and are not a work of this project. See firmware/README.md for provenance and the legal
    note.

libusb-1.0
    Linked at build time. LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not distributed as part of this
    source tree.

Python runtime dependencies (web/requirements.txt)
    FastAPI, uvicorn, python-multipart, numpy, tifffile, Pillow, pyusb — each
    under its own permissive license (MIT / BSD / HPND). Not distributed as
    part of this source tree.

test/fixtures/eeprom/
    Eight unmodified EEPROM section dumps (base F-135 serial 2233, F-135+
    serial 16402) from Ali Bosworth's pakon-reference, credited contributor
    Mats Fagerberg. CC BY 4.0, not covered by the AGPL. Used only as offline
    parser test fixtures. See test/fixtures/eeprom/README.md and LICENSE there
    for attribution and provenance.

